# Build output, so the context carries source and nothing the SDK inside the image will produce.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# The Logo Store: fetched logos and a snapshot. Baking a stale one into an image would be a
# quietly wrong image — a container is expected to start with an empty store and fill it.
**/store/

# The tests never run inside the image; the image builds the server.
Season42.Bff.Tests/

.DS_Store
